- Fix: OOM Kill when no memory for duckdb by control memory and threads options added: memoryLimit, tempDir, maxTempSize, maxThreads, preserveInsertionOrder (#261)
- Add `FDA_MAX_CONCURRENT_REFRESH_JOBS` Maximum number of concurrent refresh jobs done by fetcher to preserve memory (#261)
- Add control backpresure between pg and minio and add `FDA_UPLOAD_PART_SIZE_MB` and `FDA_UPLOAD_QUEUE_SIZE` to control concurrent in-flight parts to preserve memory (#261)
- Add: support for MongoDB aggregation pipelines in FDA queries, with proper validation and read-only stages (#197)
- Add: use FIWARE headers (`srv`, `subsrv`, `corr`) provided in API requests for logging, with a generated correlation ID when `corr` is not provided (#188)
- Add: improve fetcher logging (Agenda jobs) and add Heartbeat with configurable interval (`FDA_FETCHER_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS`) (#214)
- Add: generated defaultDataAccess now supports comma-separated values for equality filters when schema is available, while remaining fully backward compatible (#253)
- Add: file upload endpoint POST /{visibility}/fdas/upload supporting CSV, XLS and XLSX files with configurable size limit (FDA_MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE) and automatic Parquet conversion (#57)
- Add: new env var FDA_UPLOAD_TMP_DIR to set upload temporal directorio it MinIO (#57)
- Update: make default outputType `ndjson` instead of `json` (#252)
- Update: mongodb dependency version from 7.0.0 to 7.5.0
- Update: @duckdb/node-api dependency version from 1.5.2-r.1 to 1.5.5-r.4
